# Source packages the add-on feed build compiles and publishes — the one list.
#
# Read by .github/workflows/build.yml (per-package SDK mode: exactly these plus
# their real dependencies) and used as the default by scripts/local-build.sh,
# so a local test build checks what CI will build. Whitespace-separated,
# '#' starts a comment.
#
# Deliberately NOT here — in the feed, never built by CI:
#   heatingrod         builds rust/host from source (~35-45 GB build dir)
# libubus-lua-async is not listed either, yet it is built: apman depends on it.
#
# The modem side of the world (wwand and its LuCI apps, qlog/qfirehose/qflash,
# ddimension-feed) lives in ddimension/openwrt-repo. Nothing here depends on it.

apman
homesync
luacurl
lua-mosquitto
nsca-ng
snapcast-mptcp
usb-relay-hid
wpad-ieee8021x
